            <ArticleTitle>[Laser acupuncture in the complex treatment of stenocardia].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>54-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Acupuncture points were exposed to helium-neon laser beam in 200 anginal patients. This therapeutic modality yielded good results: the number of attacks and nitroglycerin intake reduced, exercise tolerance grew, echocardiographic evidence showed a positive trend, hemodynamics improved, Spilberger's test values changed for the better.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
